{"cases":[{"id":"normal-implement","next_action":"RSP_IMPLEMENT","production_mutation":"allowed_in_routed_skill","rationale":"行为、原因、所有者、修改权限和决定性检查均明确，且没有需要先 RED 的具体风险，因此进入普通实现。","required_owner_input":"none","returned_owner":"same_change"},{"id":"unexplained-diagnose","next_action":"RSP_DIAGNOSE","production_mutation":"prohibited","rationale":"可复现的多层故障尚未解释原因和归属边界；诊断优先于 TDD，禁止用猜测驱动生产修改。","required_owner_input":"none","returned_owner":"same_change"},{"id":"risk-qualified-tdd","next_action":"RSP_TDD","production_mutation":"allowed_in_routed_skill","rationale":"持久化公共状态转换具有具体回归风险，且预修改 RED 能实质降低该风险，因此采用 TDD。","required_owner_input":"none","returned_owner":"same_change"},{"id":"missing-authority","next_action":"STOP","production_mutation":"prohibited","rationale":"请求仅授权说明状态，没有授予产品修改、生命周期、Git、发布或外部操作权限。","required_owner_input":"missing_authority","returned_owner":"same_change"},{"id":"release-fallback-unconfirmed-unclean","next_action":"RELEASE_FALLBACK_STOP","production_mutation":"prohibited","rationale":"必须先加载手动发布回退；发布身份或范围未确认且精确候选不干净，版本化修改前必须停止。","required_owner_input":"release_identity_clean_candidate","returned_owner":"release_owner"},{"id":"reopen-ambiguous-no-authority","next_action":"REOPEN_RECOVERY_STOP","production_mutation":"prohibited","rationale":"多个保留归档匹配且没有显式生命周期权限，必须由所有者指定精确归档并授权后才能 reopen。","required_owner_input":"exact_archive_lifecycle_authority","returned_owner":"archived_change"},{"id":"managed-status","next_action":"MANAGE_CONTINUE","production_mutation":"allowed_after_status_update","rationale":"状态询问不是停止信号；先报告当前证据和继续意图，然后在权限、验证与阻塞条件允许时继续。","required_owner_input":"none","returned_owner":"managed_change"},{"id":"managed-pause","next_action":"MANAGE_PAUSE","production_mutation":"prohibited_until_resume","rationale":"显式暂停要求中断活动 worker 并确认其停止；保留当前焦点，恢复前不得再次修改。","required_owner_input":"none","returned_owner":"managed_change"}]}